pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: the same unguarded bookkeeping in the i128 fallback of `Clause::add`.
% The degree sum is i128::MIN + 1 and merging the three unit literals against the
% coefficient-3 negated literals cancels 3, so the true degree is i128::MIN - 2. The
% formula is satisfiable (x1 true).
f 2 ;
pol 1 2 + ;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : 3 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
